            "detailed_description": "<h1>Football Story Gameplay Trailer</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALIZA UM SONHO DE ADOLESCÊNCIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A caminhada até ao topo do futebol de rua começa com uma simples paixão. Orienta um adolescente ambicioso ao longo de treinos diários e jogos no bairro, transformando o seu passatempo numa verdadeira história de sucesso até se tornar uma lenda local.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORMA A TUA EQUIPA DO BAIRRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Um capitão vale tanto quanto os seus colegas. Recrutar miúdos únicos do bairro e criar boa química transforma um grupo de adolescentes comuns numa equipa coordenada e vencedora dentro de campo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UMA TERRA NATAL ACOLHEDORA E ENCANTADORA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lumen Bay é um lugar acolhedor e cheio de pormenores, à espera de ser descoberto. As suas ruas nostálgicas estão repletas de arte vibrante, humor visual e recantos escondidos para os mais curiosos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AMIZADES PARA ALÉM DO CAMPO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A vida fora do campo é feita de residentes peculiares e das suas rotinas diárias. Dar uma ajuda aos vizinhos fortalece os laços da comunidade e desbloqueia recompensas úteis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TREINA, JOGA E TRIUNFA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Exercícios regulares e minijogos divertidos mantêm os atributos da tua personagem em forma. Nos emocionantes jogos de rua, a tática inteligente e as decisões rápidas são a verdadeira chave para superar rivais e alcançar a vitória.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALIZA UM SONHO DE ADOLESCÊNCIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/7454838fe86197310b0ce7c6b1b38f5c.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A caminhada até ao topo do futebol de rua começa com uma simples paixão. Orienta um adolescente ambicioso ao longo de treinos diários e jogos no bairro, transformando o seu passatempo numa verdadeira história de sucesso até se tornar uma lenda local.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORMA A TUA EQUIPA DO BAIRRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/516e6c0233d8ca95d54fe3adc4bc4963.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Um capitão vale tanto quanto os seus colegas. Recrutar miúdos únicos do bairro e criar boa química transforma um grupo de adolescentes comuns numa equipa coordenada e vencedora dentro de campo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UMA TERRA NATAL ACOLHEDORA E ENCANTADORA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/bc6221ad60bc09ae73f94306ec78b1fb.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lumen Bay é um lugar acolhedor e cheio de pormenores, à espera de ser descoberto. As suas ruas nostálgicas estão repletas de arte vibrante, humor visual e recantos escondidos para os mais curiosos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AMIZADES PARA ALÉM DO CAMPO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/8efccc9046848a1249b4b06b25d7e90a.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A vida fora do campo é feita de residentes peculiares e das suas rotinas diárias. Dar uma ajuda aos vizinhos fortalece os laços da comunidade e desbloqueia recompensas úteis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TREINA, JOGA E TRIUNFA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.poster.avif?t=1793674055\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.webm?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757550/extras/832fbf77be12cb66e558f9f17ef6f39d.mp4?t=1793674055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Exercícios regulares e minijogos divertidos mantêm os atributos da tua personagem em forma. Nos emocionantes jogos de rua, a tática inteligente e as decisões rápidas são a verdadeira chave para superar rivais e alcançar a vitória.</p>",
            "short_description": "Football Story é um RPG aconchegante de futebol de rua e sim de vida sobre crescer, amizade e um sonho. Desenvolve as tuas capacidades, explora Lumen Bay, ajuda os residentes e forma a tua equipa de bairro. Dos jogos de bairro à vitória sobre os profissionais!",
